  "title": "No-Knead Focaccia",
  "description": "Chef John's no-knead focaccia has a soft texture with lots of big bubbles, a crispy exterior, and a delicious flavor thanks to a long fermentation.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-07-29T09:00:00-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2024-07-24T10:50:54-04:00",
